# Tags @s with _air_like if the block at the current execution position is air or light_block_0..15
tag @s remove _air_like
execute if block ~~~ air run tag @s add _air_like
execute if block ~~~ light_block_0 run tag @s add _air_like
execute if block ~~~ light_block_1 run tag @s add _air_like
